### 1. 1件登録する
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "category": "マーケティング",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-04-10"
}

### 2. 1件取得する
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1

### 3. 1件更新する
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "競合サイトを5つ調べる",
  "detail": "調査結果をスプレッドシートにまとめる",
  "category": "マーケティング",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-04-10",
  "completed": false
}

### 4. 1件削除する
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/23

###　追加
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?category=就職活動

### 5. 祝日を直接取ってくる
GET https://holidays-jp.github.io/api/v1/date.json


### 7. 窓口と会話を始める
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": { "name": "requests.http", "version": "1.0" }
  }
}

### 8. 道具の一覧をもらう
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: 54edd0ac-ebc3-4bca-a2f2-990d30f40bda

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/list", "params": {} }


### 9. 道具を1つ呼んでみる
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: 54edd0ac-ebc3-4bca-a2f2-990d30f40bda

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "list_todos",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}